{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-05-06 06:00:00', 'title': "IBM UNVEILS WORLD'S FIRST 2 NANOMETER CHIP TECHNOLOGY, OPENING A NEW FRONTIER FOR SEMICONDUCTORS", 'text': "ALBANY, N.Y., MAY 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IBM (NYSE:\xa0IBM) TODAY UNVEILED A BREAKTHROUGH IN SEMICONDUCTOR DESIGN AND PROCESS WITH THE DEVELOPMENT OF THE WORLD'S FIRST CHIP ANNOUNCED WITH 2 NANOMETER (NM) NANOSHEET TECHNOLOGY."}